.\nLately the number of sightings of horrors have grown tremendously. People wander off the beaten paths only to be found years later, horribly mutated and partly insane, if they are found at all. It is becoming evident something is stirring deep below Maj'Eyal.\nThat something is you.\n","source_tag":"init.lua description","target":"不是所有的冒险者都在寻求财富，也不是所有保卫世界的人都心存善念。最近，恐魔在大陆上出现的次数急剧增加。不断有人在偏僻的小路上失踪，有时几年后才被人发现，身体却遭受了恐怖的变异，进入了疯狂之中，也有时候再也无法寻到踪迹。很明显，在马基·埃亚尔的大地深处，有某种东西正在暗中活动。\n那种东西——就是你。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dcb81f219ee8b4026daed5d29be6614268b274aa907029339f92f4966784f7ad","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"00be90d31d4ec2b5410ef6f02e99683386b77b19753df0aaf1e4ae7bd617608e","logical_entry_identity":"fc16d645aff61ae8e1a1a48ae4958617bda56ce0198a241d2de916d6ff34b735","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"#{bold}##RED#%s loses %d health and is almost overcome by the entropy!#{normal}##LAST##","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#{bold}##RED#%s受熵能影响流失%d生命值，并几乎被熵能吞噬！#{normal}##LAST##"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7e46f0b5fa12b3207ef93226f4276b6033c20d5b67e2183c9e94ac1f9127b22","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"00d110ae42be49a802e5c3493525644667729095017ac385c9117ab3b0923126","logical_entry_identity":"c8816fb65df67acc43fba1f6dce87db455dfba487cfdb7988d10232690fd836b","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#(%d linked)#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#CRIMSON#(%d 伤害链接)#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd9f237ffd035873e1034fdd8cbc4a96eb632f25224b717f0086d9e42ff0a7af","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"00d51a05a0792f7f17d0942ba1079cbaf0fa542e3e9527e4f3f417f50aae5b09","logical_entry_identity":"8bcfceb6d65012400df32d86da3d7e23da651362ccf4ebc59bdf177fb399ad3c","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"When you make your pustules explode you leave a pool of defiled blood on the ground for 5 turns.\n\t\tFoes caught inside get assaulted by black tentacles every turn, dealing %d%% darkness tentacle damage and covering them in your black blood for 2 turns.\n\t\tCreatures that hit you while covered in your blood heal you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe healing received increases with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每次脓包爆裂时，你会在地上留下一滩持续 5 回合的污血。\n\t\t范围内的敌人每回合将被污血中产生的触手纠缠，受到 %d%% 暗影触手伤害并被污血覆盖 2 回合。\n\t\t被污血覆盖的敌人击中你时，你受到 %d%% 相应伤害的治疗。\n\t\t治疗系数受法术强度影响。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1415aee7a72b86a544a29d6cdd61e917d0aeba071c1b3acd46d8085415174e5","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"00ffc3389ec2a19eae1a47cbd7ad1b584e72c98eb5a064719831c6fcee35f647","logical_entry_identity":"aacb257a70d5bdb2d72fdda4a34d48e0819d254f418933fe31ec31707206d4a8","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"splattered remains of an adventurer","source_tag":"_t","target":"一名冒险家被击碎的血肉残骸"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c158bf47296ebb7125004eb7026fde7d57036b4320492ebad951040aa7d781f5","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"010443bc9ef48919803d0eecc25ef2c8effe72c0c3081c8a882326d4bd674c91","logical_entry_identity":"49040d9a9ca67317f75682faabaadf976805ed41e8dcfb6d11337c98b396b771","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Demonic Red Skin","source_tag":"_t","target":"恶魔红皮肤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"200f1db6fc8958fcc3f6684422e4148c79414c82c37945d667415070cd9515f9","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"0106772d702a62c6e24b84d1f241c1ed3963d466dd550656085d43e828a1ac2d","logical_entry_identity":"e497cdb8ad98a2a7ac13984ace80051d44686c567b0a8e5b17cd9aa915a753ac","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Not enough space to invoke your horror!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"没有召唤恐魔的空间！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5fab8a8c1ae5c37f109b9aab18c6e3fc71c5dd81856fa67877f8865eb4db64dd","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"01bdde51339405bcee58587a7117c5a1a073e94ba4859f2080f4d1c322286bdd","logical_entry_identity":"62c528230e55d647087dbd2013c8442312681f5d4ee7973bced8fc1d8df5ce27","normalized_path":"tome-cu